# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A control override retunes a base: the starfield pushed to warp. On top,
# three sprites each running at their own rate — a planet, a rocket whose
# exhaust flickers at 12 fps, and a little alien waving at 2 (a 64x64 panel
# gets a second, mirrored by flags 3 and waving at 3).
S - Space Cadet
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Warp
I @pat/starfield-2d
C sliderWarpPercent 5242880
L sprite 18 3 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Planet
I @spr/planet
L sprite 6 9 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Rocket
I @spr/rocket
L sprite 20 22 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Alien
I @spr/pixel-alien
L sprite 44 42 0 0 normal 100 none fill 3
N Alien 2
I @spr/pixel-alien
A 3
